{
	"Site": "Nexus",
	"Id": 6940,
	"Name": "What Does the Fox Say",
	"Author": "ArchAngelKiragis",
	"AuthorLabel": "Angela Ranna",
	"Description": "So I loved the mod that reskinned your truffle-hunting pigs as truffle-hunting foxes, but it was always annoying that they still did pig grunts. Working with the modding community, I found that Custom Music could be used to replace sounds as well (or add new sounds, for others just learning this), so I decided to start making a collection of sounds for popular pet and animal reskins using it.\n<br />\n<br />For deer and llama sounds for Elle's mods, Greenoctahedron already has you covered here:\u00A0[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/4220]https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/4220\n<br />\n<br />[/url]If any mod authors want to package these sounds into their mod just let me know when it's done and I'll take this version down.\n<br />\n<br />[size=5]Install[/size]\n<br />[list=1]\n<br />[*][url=https://smapi.io/]Install the latest version of SMAPI[/url].\n<br />[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/3043]Install the latest version of Custom Music[/url]\uFEFF.\n<br />[*]Download the sound or sounds you want and unzip them into\u00A0[font=Courier New]Stardew Valley/Mods[/font].\n<br />[*]Run the game using SMAPI.\n<br />[/list]\n<br />[size=5]How to use[/size]\n<br />Each one should be modular, just unzip and open your game! If you unzip into the Mods folder as-is, they should all unpack into Mods&#92;WhatDoesTheFoxSay.\n<br />\n<br />[size=5]Compatibility[/size]\n<br />[list]\n<br />[*]Tested with Stardew Valley 1.4.5 on Windows.\n<br />[*]Tested in single player.\n<br />[/list]\n<br />[size=5]Catch me in the #making-mods channel of the SDV discord or post here to drop me feedback!\n<br />[/size][size=4]Partially inspired by\u00A0[/size][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/2140]Pet Sounds for Other Mods[/url][size=4]\uFEFF. My goal is to get at least all of these sounds covered.[/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=5]Regarding Pokemon\n<br />[/size]The cries for the pokemon from each of their original games are pretty easy to find, but that's usually just a garbled blast of midi tones. I'll do my best to find them voicing their own names like in the anime, but if anyone has a good source of those sound bytes please let me know in the comments here or in the SDV discord.\n<br />\n<br />[size=5]Sounds in Angel's Sounds Shoppe:\n<br />[/size]-Dog bark to fox yips.\n<br />-Pig oink to fox snuffles.\n<br />-Half a second of silence to quiet things you don't like or for things like Totoros that don't logically have sounds.\n<br />-Okami\u00A0Amaterasu yawn\n<br />-Cat to Umbreon call\n<br />-Cat to Espeon call\n<br />-Cat to Eevee call\n<br />-Cat to Moogle kupo\n<br />-Cathulhu\n<br />-Pet to crow\n<br />-Void dog\n<br />-Pig oink to bear growl\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />[size=5]TODO:[/size][list]\n<br />[*]Bulbusaur cat\n<br />[*]Charmander dog\n<br />[*]Chimchar dog\n<br />[*]Torchic cat\n<br />[*]Carbuncle cat\n<br />[*]Dratini\n<br />[*]Glaceon\n<br />[*]Goomy\n<br />[*]Leafeon\n<br />[*]Piplup\n<br />[*]Shaymin\n<br />[*]Squirtle dog\n<br />[*]Totodile cat\n<br />[*]Sylveon\n<br />[*]Turtwig dog\n<br />[*]Treecko cat\n<br />[*]Vulpix\n<br />[*]Horse sounds? Chocobo, yoshi\n<br />[/list]\n<br />[size=5]Example content.json of multiple overrides for things like Silence:[/size]\n<br />[size=2]{\n<br />\u00A0 \u00A0 \"Music\" : [\n<br />\u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 {\n<br />\u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \"Id\": \"dog_bark\",\n<br />\u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \"File\": \"HalfSecondSilence.wav\",\n<br />\u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \"Loop\": false,\n<br />\u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \"Ambient\": true\n<br />\u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 },\n<br />\u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 {\n<br />\u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \"Id\": \"dog_pant\",\n<br />\u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0\u00A0\"File\": \"HalfSecondSilence.wav\",\n<br />\u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \"Loop\": false,\n<br />\u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \"Ambient\": true\n<br />\u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 },\n<br />\u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 ]\n<br />}\n<br />\n<br />[/size][size=5]Sources\n<br />[/size]Fox sounds:\u00A0https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dSGfdKeeKV4\n<br />Amaterasu:\u00A0https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sTG2okzoOq0\n<br />Moogle:\u00A0https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ytfD1p6SbZw\n<br />Cathulhu:\u00A0https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rELTY-GcuPk\n<br />Crow:\u00A0https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bd-GyU-S6Dk\n<br />Void dog:\u00A0https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3Nc5LeZbAHk\n<br />Bear:\u00A0https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3o2cMGCMK2c\n<br />Pokemon:\u00A0https://www.sounds-resource.com/3ds/pokemonultrasunultramoon/,\u00A0https://www.sounds-resource.com/nintendo_switch/pokemonswordshield/",
